      <sect2 role="installation">
        <title>Installation of Cosmic-monitor</title>

    <para>Prepare Cosmic-monitor for compilation:</para>

    <para>Fetch the dependencies, ensuring the exact versions recorded in the
      existing <filename>Cargo.lock</filename> file are used:</para>

        <screen><userinput remap="pre">cargo fetch --locked</userinput></screen>

      <para>To Compile the Package, issue:</para>

        <screen><userinput remap="make">cargo build --profile release</userinput></screen>

      <para>Now Install the Package, issue:</para>

        <screen><userinput remap="install">install -vDm755 target/release/cosmic-monitor /usr/bin/cosmic-monitor &amp;&amp;

install -vDm644 target/xdgen/com.system76.CosmicMonitor.desktop \
  /usr/share/applications/ &amp;&amp;

install -vDm644 target/xdgen/com.system76.CosmicMonitor.metainfo.xml \
  /usr/share/metainfo/ &amp;&amp;

cp -rv res/icons/hicolor/* /usr/share/icons/hicolor/</userinput></screen>

      </sect2>

